  <title>Locations</title>

  <p>Inventory is counted at each location separately. The
  <gui>Locations</gui> window opens from the <gui>Location</gui> button of
  <link xref="receive_orders"/> and <link xref="inventory_transfer"/>.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>To add one, click <gui>New</gui>, type the <gui>Location
    name</gui> and click <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>To rename one, double click it, change the name and click
    <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Delete</gui> deletes the selected location. A location that
    has ever held stock cannot be deleted.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
